<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/70dfbe15-7eef-492b-bf55-6e32c4f220b0> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    bflr:supportinghost dalia-community:aac7b1be-cf00-4fdc-a26a-e8e0e1410b18 ;
    dcterms:description "In this enlightening video, you delve into the realm of taxonomy. Discover the intricacies of \"taxonomic harmonization\" as we explore its definition, essential prerequisites, and practical execution. If you're engaged with biodiversity data, these vital insights on taxonomy are integral to your work." ;
