<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/a0682fc4-db0b-42f2-83e7-2b52fe7b838f> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    bflr:supportinghost dalia-community:aac7b1be-cf00-4fdc-a26a-e8e0e1410b18 ;
    dcterms:description """This is a short R script to automatically format questions in LiaScript format, based on text in a table.

The structure of questions in the table is the same that R package GIFTr is using to format questions in GIFT format.

The example questions are from the HeFDI Selbstlerneinheit Forschungsdatenmanagement - eine Online-Einführung (HeFDI Data Learning Materials). These questions are also used in the NFDI4Biodiversity Self-Study Unit—Research Data Management for Biodiversity.""" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/eng> ;
    dcterms:license <http://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-4.0> ;
    dcterms:title "Bulk formatting of questions in LiaScript format" ;
    rec:recommender dalia-community:aac7b1be-cf00-4fdc-a26a-e8e0e1410b18 ;
