<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/cff748b3-7baa-406d-8b38-f8e109b54555> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    bflr:supportinghost dalia-community:aac7b1be-cf00-4fdc-a26a-e8e0e1410b18 ;
    dcterms:description "This publication showcases the NFDI4Biodiversity & GfÖ Winter School 2022, a transformative one-week course program designed to equip young scientists with essential Research Data Management (RDM) skills tailored for biodiversity and environmental data. Organized by the NFDI4Biodiversity consortium, the Winter School fostered data literacy and promoted sustainable research practices within the ecological and environmental science communities. The publication offers an overview of the Winter School's structure, curriculum, and highlights." ;
